{
  "sourceStoryId": "7f0271e4-5944-4184-855e-4fd087f49866",
  "turns": [
    {
      "id": "t1",
      "speaker": "gouer",
      "to": [
        "granny",
        "liushi"
      ],
      "mode": "normal",
      "text": "这日子眼看着冷了，柴米还没着落，光坐着愁能愁出米来？",
      "knowledgeRefs": [],
      "factRefs": [
        "winter_need"
      ],
      "respondsTo": [],
      "actionIntent": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "t2",
      "speaker": "granny",
      "to": [
        "gouer"
      ],
      "mode": "normal",
      "text": "你倒会发急。你祖上跟金陵王家连过宗，这层旧亲你就想不起来？",
      "knowledgeRefs": [
        "t1"
      ],
      "factRefs": [
        "wang_old_kinship"
      ],
      "respondsTo": [
        "t1"
      ],
      "actionIntent": "turn"
    },
    {
      "id": "t3",
      "speaker": "gouer",
      "to": [
        "granny"
      ],
      "mode": "normal",
      "text": "连过宗又怎样，这些年走动都断了。我爹倒跟荣府里周瑞办过事，那是王夫人的陪房。",
      "knowledgeRefs": [
        "t2"
      ],
      "factRefs": [
        "gouer_zhou_connection",
        "zhou_household_role"
      ],
      "respondsTo": [
        "t2"
      ],
      "actionIntent": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "t4",
      "speaker": "granny",
      "to": [
        "gouer"
      ],
      "mode": "normal",
      "text": "周瑞我听说过，可多年没来往。求他递话，人家凭什么认咱这门子旧交？",
      "knowledgeRefs": [
        "t3"
      ],
      "factRefs": [
        "granny_zhou_awareness"
      ],
      "respondsTo": [
        "t3"
      ],
      "actionIntent": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "t5",
      "speaker": "liushi",
      "to": [
        "granny"
      ],
      "mode": "normal",
      "text": "娘，那年您带我去王家，二小姐不是挺和气？如今她做了王夫人，兴许还记着旧。",
      "knowledgeRefs": [
        "t4"
      ],
      "factRefs": [
        "granny_wang_visit"
      ],
      "respondsTo": [
        "t4"
      ],
      "actionIntent": "approach"
    },
    {
      "id": "t6",
      "speaker": "granny",
      "to": [
        "liushi"
      ],
      "mode": "normal",
      "text": "记着旧是一说，门房让不让进又是一说。我这身旧衣裳站到那门口，人家先就嫌。",
      "knowledgeRefs": [
        "t5"
      ],
      "factRefs": [
        "granny_wang_visit"
      ],
      "respondsTo": [
        "t5"
      ],
      "actionIntent": "shake"
    },
    {
      "id": "t7",
      "speaker": "gouer",
      "to": [
        "granny"
      ],
      "mode": "normal",
      "text": "娘这话在理。可总得有人去。我这张脸拉不下去，您老去，倒还像替小辈跑一趟。",
      "knowledgeRefs": [
        "t6"
      ],
      "factRefs": [
        "winter_need"
      ],
      "respondsTo": [
        "t6"
      ],
      "actionIntent": "turn"
    },
    {
      "id": "t8",
      "speaker": "granny",
      "to": [
        "gouer"
      ],
      "mode": "normal",
      "text": "合着难处都推给我了。我去试，先说清，只去问周瑞能不能给王夫人递个话，求些过冬的帮衬，成不成不敢包。",
      "knowledgeRefs": [
        "t7",
        "t3",
        "t5"
      ],
      "factRefs": [
        "granny_zhou_awareness",
        "granny_wang_visit"
      ],
      "respondsTo": [
        "t7"
      ],
      "actionIntent": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "t9",
      "speaker": "liushi",
      "to": [
        "granny"
      ],
      "mode": "normal",
      "text": "娘一个人去我不放心。明早我陪您到荣府那条街口，您能进去就说话，我在外头等着。",
      "knowledgeRefs": [
        "t8"
      ],
      "factRefs": [
        "family_roles"
      ],
      "respondsTo": [
        "t8"
      ],
      "actionIntent": "approach"
    },
    {
      "id": "t10",
      "speaker": "granny",
      "to": [
        "liushi"
      ],
      "mode": "normal",
      "text": "你去了，孩子谁看？板儿青儿丢给谁？",
      "knowledgeRefs": [
        "t9"
      ],
      "factRefs": [
        "family_roles"
      ],
      "respondsTo": [
        "t9"
      ],
      "actionIntent": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "t11",
      "speaker": "liushi",
      "to": [
        "granny",
        "gouer"
      ],
      "mode": "normal",
      "text": "狗儿在家看着孩子，我送您到街口就回，家里不耽搁。",
      "knowledgeRefs": [
        "t10"
      ],
      "factRefs": [
        "family_roles"
      ],
      "respondsTo": [
        "t10"
      ],
      "actionIntent": "turn"
    },
    {
      "id": "t12",
      "speaker": "gouer",
      "to": [
        "liushi"
      ],
      "mode": "normal",
      "text": "我看孩子就我看孩子。明早你们早些动身，日头高了那门里人更多，更不好说话。",
      "knowledgeRefs": [
        "t11"
      ],
      "factRefs": [
        "family_roles"
      ],
      "respondsTo": [
        "t11"
      ],
      "actionIntent": "nod"
    },
    {
      "id": "t13",
      "speaker": "granny",
      "to": [
        "gouer",
        "liushi"
      ],
      "mode": "normal",
      "text": "那就这么定。先寻周瑞，他肯给王夫人递话最好；不肯，我也只好空手回来，不兴埋怨。",
      "knowledgeRefs": [
        "t12",
        "t8"
      ],
      "factRefs": [
        "granny_zhou_awareness"
      ],
      "respondsTo": [
        "t12"
      ],
      "actionIntent": "none"
    }
  ]
}